@customerToken =
@photographerToken =
@adminToken =
@photoId =
@orderId =
@photographerId =

### POST - Crear pedido (cliente)
### Copiá orderId y photographerId de la respuesta para los demás requests.
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "photos": ["{{photoId}}"]
}

###

### GET - Ver mis pedidos (cliente; incluye estados, pagos e historial)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###

### POST - Adjuntar comprobante (cliente; máximo 5 MB)
### Reemplazá ./receipt.png por un JPG, PNG, WEBP o PDF válido.
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders/{{orderId}}/photographer/{{photographerId}}/receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=RevelaReceiptBoundary

--RevelaReceiptBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="receipt"; filename="receipt.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./receipt.png
--RevelaReceiptBoundary--

###

### Alternativa al upload: cliente avisando que envió el comprobante por WhatsApp
### Usar con una sub-venta pendiente o rechazada, no después del upload anterior.
POST http://localhost:3000/api/orders/{{orderId}}/photographer/{{photographerId}}/whatsapp-notice
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###

### GET - Ver/descargar comprobante (cliente dueño, fotógrafo destinatario o admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/{{orderId}}/photographer/{{photographerId}}/receipt
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###

### PATCH - Marcar la sub-venta como abonada (fotógrafo dueño; requiere receipt_sent)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/photographer/sales/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{photographerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "paid"
}

###

### PATCH - Marcar la sub-venta como entregada (requiere paid)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/photographer/sales/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{photographerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "delivered"
}

###

### GET - Descargar original (cliente dueño o admin; sub-venta paid/delivered)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/{{orderId}}/photos/{{photoId}}/download
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###

### PATCH - Rechazar comprobante (fotógrafo; usar otro pedido en estado receipt_sent)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/photographer/sales/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{photographerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "rejected",
    "reason": "El comprobante no permite verificar el importe."
}

###

### PATCH - Cancelar sub-venta antes del pago (solo admin; usar un pedido pendiente)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/photographer/sales/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "cancelled",
    "photographerId": "{{photographerId}}"
}

###

### GET - Consultar un pedido (cliente dueño o admin)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{customerToken}}

###

### PATCH - Actualizar estado global heredado del pedido (solo admin; no habilita originales)
PATCH http://localhost:3000/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "status": "paid"
}
